OL,3,GNEWSAI was 'fully transparent' about
OL,4,Aon-the run killer case - justice
OL,5,Aminister
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe justice minister has denied
OL,8,Fmisleading the Northern Ireland
OL,9,FAssembly over the circumstances
OL,10,Fsurrounding the prison release of
OL,11,Fconvicted killer Gary Anderson,
OL,12,Finsisting she had been "fully
OL,13,Ftransparent".
OL,15,FAnswering questions at Stormont, Naomi
OL,16,FLong said she "took exception" to any
OL,17,Fsuggestion that she had "sought to
OL,18,Fmislead this House, inadvertently or
OL,19,Fotherwise" when addressing assembly
OL,20,Fmembers last week.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
