OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAI was 'fully transparent' about
OL,4,Aon-the run killer case - justice
OL,5,Aminister
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnderson, who is one of two brothers
OL,8,Fjailed for life in 2023 for the murder
OL,9,Fof Karol Kelly in Londonderry, remains
OL,10,Fat large a week after he absconded
OL,11,Fwhile attending his father's funeral.
OL,13,FLong said she had provided the
OL,14,Finformation she had at the time with
OL,15,F"full candour".
